Template: homelab-worker/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-worker/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-worker/api_base
Type: string
Default: http://localhost:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable:
 Written into config.yml's homelab_api.base_url — every request this
 app handles is authenticated by introspecting the caller's JWT here.

Template: homelab-worker/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2512
Description: Port for homelab-worker to listen on:

Template: homelab-worker/advertise_host
Type: string
Default: 127.0.0.1
Description: This host's own address to advertise in the service registry:
 Written into config.yml's registry.host -- what homelab-api's gateway
 actually connects to when forwarding /api/v1/jobs/* requests here.
 Leave as 127.0.0.1 only if this service runs on the SAME host as
 homelab-api itself; set it to this host's real reachable address
 (e.g. its data-plane IP) for any distributed deployment, or every
 gateway forward will try to reach homelab-api's own loopback instead
 of this service.

Template: homelab-worker/storage_path
Type: string
Default: /var/lib/homelab/worker-storage
Description: Directory to store finished job artifacts in:
 Owned by the homelab service user. Written into config.yml's
 storage_path — see README.md.
